1
00:00:04,203 --> 00:00:09,318
The red light fades into the night,
I walk into the yellow light.

2
00:00:09,336 --> 00:00:14,604
My father speaks with icy tone:
"One hour with that boy alone!"

3
00:00:15,213 --> 00:00:24,166
I am twenty-four years old!
I won't do what I am told!

4
00:00:24,708 --> 00:00:30,561
I love Paul with all my soul!
You can't keep us in control!

5
00:00:34,565 --> 00:00:39,727
My mother laughs a bitter sneer,
As if I am a child in fear.

6
00:00:39,737 --> 00:00:44,805
I take a step into the room,
And shatter all their heavy gloom.

7
00:00:45,537 --> 00:00:54,470
I am twenty-four years old!
I won't do what I am told!

8
00:00:55,014 --> 00:01:00,155
I love Paul with all my soul!
You can't keep us in control!

9
00:01:00,230 --> 00:01:05,312
No "please", no rules, no church to pray,
Forget the words you try to say!

10
00:01:05,411 --> 00:01:10,745
I feel his love in every vein,
And I won't hide inside your pain!

11
00:01:12,505 --> 00:01:21,491
I am twenty-four years old!
I won't do what I am told!

12
00:01:22,003 --> 00:01:27,191
I love Paul with me soul!
You can't keep us in control!

13
00:01:27,353 --> 00:01:32,268
My father snarls: "He can't return!
No more garage for him to earn!"

14
00:01:32,447 --> 00:01:37,648
You lock the door, you take the key,
But you will never silence me!

15
00:01:37,764 --> 00:01:42,513
I scream it loud, I scream it clear,
I love him more than all your fear!

16
00:01:42,523 --> 00:01:48,204
My lioness is wide awake,
This fire is about to break!

